{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"全国握手会in京都"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"来てくださったみなさん\nありがとうございました。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ミニライブ\n♪指望遠鏡\n♪春のメロディー\n♪やさしさなら間に合ってる\n♪制服のマネキン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの人で溢れてて\n感動した...おおん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディー、\n久しぶりに踊ったのかなんか\n動きがぎこちなくなった。\n上手くいかなかった...反省。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも楽しかった♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日の抽選会はね！\nメンバーがガチで選んだ\nクリスマスプレゼントの抽選"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なににしようか悩んだけど...\n私がかわいいなって思ったのに\nしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっかサンタからのプレゼント、\n当たった方おめでとうございます"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ね？ポーチかわいいでしょ？うへへ\nミニファイルもぜひ使ってください！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして、握手会。\nあすかとペアでした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あすかは朝から体調が悪かった\nみたいだけどライブも最後まで出て\n握手会も辛い中よく頑張ってました。\nあの調子だと出れないかなって\n心配してたけど。。\nあすかは本当に強い子だなあ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"辛かったね。あすか\n本当によく頑張ったね。\nお疲れ様＊"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何度か休憩しながらで、\n後半は私に一人でしたが\nみなさん本当に優しくて...\n握手しにしてくれて嬉しかったです！\nサンタさんとかトナカイさんの\n格好とか...みんなかわいかったで笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日も来てくれた方も\n今日たくさん来てくれて\nめっちゃ楽しかったあ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会入会したい！\nって言ってくれて嬉しかった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"リクエスト5\nポニーテール"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりにポニーテールしたよー\n踊ってる時うしろで髪ゆらゆらしてて\n違和感←ぇ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"握手会に行ってみたいなぁ～\nっていうメンバーは？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ゆったん、らりん"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いいダイエット方法とかある？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夜18時以降食べない。\n甘いものは食べない。\n生野菜から食べる。\n健康的に痩せたいなら\n3食しっかり食べる。\n適度な運動。\n...まじめに書いてみたよ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0008.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"私も頑張る～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"メンバーの誰の家に\nよく泊まりに行きますか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まひろ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クリスマスイヴ？イブ？\n本当はどっちなのー？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あーどっちもあるよね。\n私はイブって言ってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"じゃがりこのおすすめの味は\nなんですか？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"チーズ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春のメロディーのタイプC と、\n個人pvが入ってるタイプBと、\nどっちが見て欲しい？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"春メロも見てほしいけど...\n個人pvは買わないと見れないから\nタイプCかな><"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写真にしているらくがきは\n手で書いているんですか(ﾉ´･ω･)ﾉ？\nコツ教えてください！"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"手で描いてるよ！\n画像ズームして描けるから\n細かい絵もなんでも描けちゃうの"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0010.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0006.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヘアメイクはみんな\n自分でやってるの？"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0007.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"できる子は自メイクだけど、\nヘアはみんなやってもらってるよ。\n私はメイクもやってもらってる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"**********"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日今日と、本当に楽し過ぎたな～\nあらためてみなさん、\nだいすきですっっっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0011.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0012.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"////"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ハッピーメリークリスマスイブ！！！！！！！！！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんてねなんてね！\nてへぺろてへぺろーーーーーー"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0009.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぐはははははははは"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"＼帰りのメンバー／"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0013.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"左上から若月、真洋\nマスクで目が見えないみさ\n生駒は...東北人。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みんなお疲れさん"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/marika.ito/img/blog/marika.ito/img/2012/12/24/5756414/0014.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日もリハ頑張ろうねー！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりか"}],"source":"archive"}